@startuml
' Palette: class; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ActorBorderColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
hide circle
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ClassBorderColor #222222
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
top to bottom direction
class PersonalRagController <<Java boundary>> {
+postMessage(id: UUID, body: MessageRequest): AnswerResponse
}
class MessageRequest <<DTO>> {
+message: String
}
class PersonalRagService <<Java control>> {
+ask(userId: UUID, id: UUID, message: String): AnswerResponse
}
class ConversationRepository <<Java repository>> {
+loadOwnedSnapshot(userId: UUID, id: UUID): ConversationSnapshot
}
class AiClient <<HTTP adapter>> {
+ask(request: InternalRagRequest): AnswerResponse
}
class RagPipeline <<Python control>> {
+run(request: InternalRagRequest): AnswerResponse
}
class ScopedRetriever <<Python service>> {
+search(scope: AuthorizedScope, query: String): EvidenceSet
}
class GroundingValidator <<Python service>> {
+validate(answer: GeneratedAnswer, evidence: EvidenceSet): ValidationResult
}
class AnswerResponse <<DTO>> {
+status: AnswerStatus
+answer: String?
+citations: PageCitation[]
}
PersonalRagController ..> MessageRequest
PersonalRagController --> PersonalRagService
PersonalRagService --> ConversationRepository
PersonalRagService --> AiClient
AiClient ..> RagPipeline : internal HTTP
RagPipeline --> ScopedRetriever
RagPipeline --> GroundingValidator
PersonalRagService ..> AnswerResponse
note bottom of PersonalRagService
Java dựng scope từ snapshot có documentVersion.
MessageRequest không cho đổi danh sách tài liệu.
end note
@enduml
